e group solvency regulation, taking insurance conglomerates controlled by non insurance institutions under regulation for the first time, thus able to supervise a series of complex risks.", "score": 0.33333334, "rerank_score": 0.3433417294618181, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "direct_evidence", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "aspect_1", "fusion_method": "aspect_query_rrf_then_bge_rerank"}}, {"document_id": "DOC-20260717-7839B3A00D0D", "chunk_id": "DOC-20260717-7839B3A00D0D-CHUNK-0005", "filename": "445_中国银保监会关于印发_保险公司非寿险业务准备金管理办法_实施细则（1—7号）的通知_细则第6号附件3.交强险业务专项准备金评估报告监管报表.xlsx", "section_title": "注：本报表中的终极损失、已决赔款、IBNR准备金均包含直接理赔费用", "page_number": null, "excerpt": "表格： 表格行证据：在《注：本报表中的终极损失、已决赔款、IBNR准备金均包含直接理赔费用》工作表“表2-合计”中，行标签为“增速”。单位：万元。1.已赚保费（再保前）=“增速”；列3=“0.01779638956”；列4=“-0.01663258509”；列5=“-0.03923689966”；列6=“-0.02189012123”；列7=“0.01797529657”；列8=“0.001933327508”；列9=“-0.0006519536738”；列10=“0.02155926676”；列11=“0.02359643766”；列12=“0.01759100357”；1.已赚保费（再保后）=“增速”；列19=“0.01779638956”；列20=“-0.01663258509”；列21=“-0.03923689966”；列22=“-0.02189012123”；列23=“0.01797529657”；列24=“0.001933327508”；列25=“-0.0006519536738”；列26=“0.02155926676”；列27=“0.02359643766”；列28=“0.01759100357”。", "score": 0.9228571428571428, "rerank_score": 0.9228571428571428, "chunk_type": "table", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "aspect_1", "sheet_name": "表2-合计", "unit": "万元", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "I100-092", "exact_support_score": 0.8571}}]}
